    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i was reading something about how certain groups might have different thresholds for pain or different ways they express symptoms, like in cardiovascular stuff. do you know if there's a clinical difference in how different races experience or report pain? like, specifically when it comes to things like acute issues? i want to make sure i'm not misinterpreting what a patient is telling me based on their background.",
